  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Any aura from a class feature, Sphere talent, or supernatural ability, succeed with flair</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> When you apply at least one flair to an attack you make, you can choose to forgo gaining the benefits of the flair to extend the radius of an aura you can create by 10 feet. You may sacrifice additional flairs if you are capable of applying them, each add 10 more feet.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/braggart#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
